                              of pyatem; see atem/LICENSE, atem/LICENSE-gpl3.txt
                              and atem/NOTICE)
  internal/fixtures/
              LGPL-3.0-only  (data copied from atemwire's test suite; see
                              internal/fixtures/README.md)
  everything else            MIT, below

